{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Sorter</i>, you\u2019re dropped into a mysterious facility with one simple directive: organize the chaos. Sort vibrant cubes into the correct chutes. Build stairways, bridges, and towers to navigate an ever-evolving environment. Master the laws of falling-object physics. Then do it all again\u2014only better, faster, and smarter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But under the surface of this serene sorting simulator lies something... strange. Clues hide in plain sight. Patterns whisper. As you unlock new abilities and advance through each handcrafted level, a deeper question begins to take shape:<br><strong>Why are you here?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Chill first-person puzzle gameplay</strong> focused on logic, color (Colorblind option), and spatial thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Build with purpose -</strong>\u00a0Use cubes to create paths, solve challenges, or just make something oddly satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Unlock new abilities\u00a0</strong>that reshape how you interact with the world and the cubes in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Uncover a hidden narrative -</strong>\u00a0Told not with words, but with puzzles, visuals, and implication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Meditative vibes</strong> with no timers, no enemies, just you and a lot of cubes with secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Officially a Sorter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3622570/210189c644684bbc00da750ec7c1e50b3e502704.jpg"},{"name":"Persistence!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3622570/a03db571a6593839968e9225a85a76543a039d9e.jpg"},{"name":"Incorrect","